		{ "id": "city.xiangguo_gate.shut", "room": "es2:d/city/xiangguo/gate", "from_zone": "city.xiangguo_gate", "to_zone": "city.xiangguo_yard", "when": "no_mark", "mark": "相国府开了门", "lines": ["相国府的大门关着。（门边可以叩门。）"], "legacy_source": "native: 第九章 A (计划 build/plans/第九章_计划.md A 包; DECISIONS「第九章 A」) — xiangguo/gate.c had no way in; the gate opens to 骆云舟's card (相国府大门 · 叩门), 续写" },
